# The tablets' payloads: each top-level .py here is a human-reviewed program the tablet factory may run
# (tablet_orders.payload_names lists them). Git holds them as they run. Left out: deploy backups and caches, and a1/,
# the A1 payload `fleet_deploy --rigby-a1` copies here from its source in the menu's repo (hard-bench).
*.bak*
*.v1-bak
__pycache__/
a1/
